# SteelForce admin portal — static prototype.
#
# No backend, database, API URL or identity provider is needed: all data is local
# mock data (src/features/*/data) served by frontend-only mock services
# (src/services/mock). Sign in with admin@gmail.com / 123456.
#
# Optional. Planning renders an interactive Google map when a browser key is set
# and the built-in demo map otherwise.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
